E8511 `ValueError` reaches a reader as a traceback, not as UI
  --> gettext.py:42:15
   |
41 |     def developer(self, value):
42 |         raise ValueError(_("Bad value"))  # E8511
   |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
43 |         raise KeyError(_("Missing %s") % value)  # E8511
44 |         raise RuntimeError(_lt("Failed {}").format(value))  # E8511
   |
help: Drop the `_()` and use an f-string

